-spoiler alert-

































-spoiler-
I have used rings of conflict to rob shops.  With ring OFF, hang around
in the shop with whatever you want to steal.  Place yourself in direct
line with the shopkeeper and two spaces away, so that he steps out of the
doorway.  Wait for monster.  When monster gets into door, put RoC ON.
Head for door.  The shopkeeper will hit monster and can't block
you.  When he kills the monster you get the next move- just waltz out of the 
shop.  Since it takes two steps to get to the door, this doesn't work
with wimpy monsters like newts, but anything that can handle a hit or
two from the shopkeeper will do.  (Of course a "c" or a "D" will take 
care of the problem even more easily, but they aren't likely to show up
on level 2.)

